@Portfolio.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5046
@access_token = paste-token-here

### Health check
GET {{Portfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### System status
GET {{Portfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/system/status
Accept: application/json

### Register user
POST {{Portfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/User/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo-user",
  "password": "DemoPassword123!"
}

### Login user
POST {{Portfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/User/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo-user",
  "password": "DemoPassword123!"
}

### Current user
GET {{Portfolio.Api_HostAddress}}/api/User/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}